Actions operate on a sequence list after the list is build.
<p>In below examples last/reverse/shuffle are actions.

{common:table}
{common:demo}{sequence:range '20..30', push='mySeq'/} {/common:demo}
{common:demo}{pull:mySeq last=3} {$sequence} {/pull:mySeq}{/common:demo}
{common:demo}{action:reverse mySeq} {$sequence} {/action:reverse}{/common:demo}
{common:demo}{sequence:auto mySeq, shuffle} {$sequence} {/sequence:auto}{/common:demo}
{/common:table}
